Description:
    Installs the strata_events and strata_event_deliveries migration into the
    host application. The Strata::Event and Strata::EventDelivery models are
    shipped by the engine directly — only the migration is copied.

    See docs/specs/durable-events/spec.md for the durable events design.

Usage:
    bin/rails generate strata:events

This will create:
    - db/migrate/<timestamp>_create_strata_events.rb

Options:
    --skip-migration-check         Skip checking if strata_events table exists
    --force                        Replace an already installed create_strata_events migration
    --skip                         Leave an already installed create_strata_events migration as is
